+## Keys and roles
+
+Every request carries `Authorization: Bearer <key>`. Keys are in the data file
+(`docs/DATA.md`). A missing or unknown key answers 401 `unauthorized`, on any
+path; a known key without permission answers 403 `forbidden`.
+
+- `viewer`: every `GET` route except `GET /audit`.
+- `cook`: the same, plus `POST /recipes/:id/cook`, `POST /batches/:id/waste`,
+  `POST /temperatures` and `POST /stocktakes/:id/counts`.
+- `manager`: everything.
+
+The table is in `src/domain/access.js`; a new route that changes data is
+manager-only until it is listed there.
+
+## Audit
+
+`GET /audit` (managers only) lists the requests that changed data, newest
+first:
+
+    [{ "id": 1, "at": "2026-10-28T10:00:00.000Z", "keyName": "seed cook",
+       "method": "POST", "path": "/recipes/1/cook", "status": 200 }]
+
+A request that was refused or failed changed nothing and has no entry. `path`
+leaves out the query string.
+
